{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "oan-da-cropsown",
    "name": "OAN DA Crop Sown",
    "description": "DA Services Crop Sown routes that returned success on the local bench at http://127.0.0.1:8200. Login stores access_token. Read regions stores region_level_value_id. Save farmer lookup stores submission_id. Saved responses are shortened live envelopes: intake forms omit the full field lists, and regions omit rows after the second.",
